      "with": ["ingredient/sugar", "ingredient/marsala"],
      "text": "Set a heatproof bowl over a pan of water at a bare simmer, making sure the bowl does not touch the water. Whisk the yolks with the sugar until pale, add the Marsala and keep whisking until the foam is thick, warm and holds a ribbon. Take it off the heat and whisk until it is cool.",
