      "with": ["ingredient/egg-yolk", "ingredient/sugar"],
      "text": "Stir the mascarpone with a spatula until smooth, without beating it hard. Stir in a spoonful of the cooled foam to loosen it, then fold in the rest in small lots until the cream is smooth.",
      "time": null,
      "temperature": null,
      "safety_points": [],
