      "text": "Lay a layer of dipped biscuits in the dish and spread half the cream over them. Make a second layer of biscuits and cover it with the rest of the cream. Chill, covered, until the dessert is firm enough to cut cleanly, ideally overnight, and sift the cocoa over the top just before serving.",
